      "title": "Go back when the server says no",
      "interviewerPrompt": "Servers fail. When a save fails, the screen must return to the truth and tell the user what happened.",
      "constraints": [
        "Add a checkbox with the class `server-down`. While it is checked, `saveLike` rejects after 400 ms.",
        "When a save fails, `label`, `aria-pressed` and `count` return to what they were before the click.",
        "Show `Could not save your like.` in an element with the class `save-error` and `role=\"alert\"`.",
        "The next click removes the error right away."
