        "Only one save runs at a time. If the user clicks during a save, wait for it to finish, then save the latest value once.",
        "If the latest value is what the server already has, send nothing more.",
        "If a save fails, drop any waiting value and return to the last value the server accepted.",
        "Show how many saves were sent in an element with the class `request-count`."
      ],
