      "id": "say-what-happened",
      "title": "Say what happened, leave nothing behind",
      "interviewerPrompt": "Finish with what users cannot see. A screen reader must hear the result, and removing the button must leave nothing running.",
      "constraints": [
        "Always keep the element with the class `save-status` on the page, with `aria-live=\"polite\"`.",
        "`Saved` goes away after 1 second. A new click cancels that wait, so an old timer cannot clear a newer message.",
        "When a save fails, `save-status` is empty, because `save-error` already says it.",
        "Removing the component during a save must leave no timer running, so `saveLike` needs a way to stop its wait."
      ],
